<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>05 · DEPLOYMENT</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1D4ED8' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12275A', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            控制面与数据面分离：规模变了，不用换产品
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 22 }}>
            {/* 控制面 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 150, background: '#12275A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>控制面</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7EA3D6', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>账号与配置</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1D4ED8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>SQLite（默认）</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>WAL 模式，单机即可跑</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1D4ED8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>PostgreSQL（可选）</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>连接池与高并发行</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 11 }}>
                        21 个版本化迁移，SQLite 与 PostgreSQL 双份脚本同步演进——从单机试点升级到集中部署，数据结构无需推倒重来。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 数据面 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'stretch', marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 150, background: '#1D4ED8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>数据面</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#CBD9F0', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>Agent 工作区</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>本地磁盘</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>Docker 沙箱</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>OpenSandbox</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>PostgreSQL</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginTop: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E6F7F9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#B6E3EA', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>腾讯云 COS</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E6F7F9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#B6E3EA', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>阿里云 OSS</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E6F7F9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#B6E3EA', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>华为云 OBS</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E6F7F9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#B6E3EA', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>通用 S3</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 11 }}>
                        工作区文件不直接落控制面：可以留在本地、放进沙箱，也可以托管到企业已有的对象存储，合规策略随存储位置走。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1D4ED8' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                今天一台笔记本跑 SQLite，明天一台服务器跑 PostgreSQL 加对象存储——产品形态不变，运维复杂度才可控。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
